; Order carrier for the dgrGcGDH gene (UniProt G8E4B5, 600 aa, one line per arm, no wrapping).
; base = the 600-aa block of L1_protein_architecture.md (the 11 N-to-Q already in it); each arm = that block + the listed substitutions.
; ONLY arm14 is ratified (home: L1 section 2). arm13 and arm15 exist for the open N68 verdict (00_07 HW.5) and are NOT to be ordered without a founder word.
; The CRO designs the final cassette (leader, tags, linkers): the sequence that is synthesised needs written sign-off BEFORE synthesis.
; Guarded by tools/in_silico/tests/test_doc_cache_sync.py (test_gene_arms_*): edit L1 or lib/constants.py -> regenerate this file.
>dgrGcGDH_arm14 RATIFIED subs=L80D,A70S,I401S

>dgrGcGDH_arm13 NOT_RATIFIED subs=L80D,I401S

>dgrGcGDH_arm15 NOT_RATIFIED subs=L80D,A70S,I401S,N68Q

